{
  "$comment": [
    "Deterministic guardrails. The CLI runs these whether or not the model",
    "remembered the rule - that is the whole point: a rule in AGENTS.md is",
    "advice, a rule in a hook is enforcement.",
    "",
    "matcher is a regex tested against toolName; the CLI anchors it as",
    "^(?:PATTERN)$, so write alternations without your own anchors.",
    "",
    "Wire-up lives in the repository being worked on, not here:",
    "  .github/copilot/protected-paths  globs the guard refuses to edit",
    "  .github/copilot/verify-cmd       one shell line: build/typecheck/test",
    "Delete either file to switch that behaviour off; delete an entry below to",
    "switch off the hook itself.",
    "",
    "preToolUse fails closed: a hook that exits non-zero denies the call. Every",
    "script here exits 0 unconditionally."
  ],

  "version": 1,

  "hooks": {
    "sessionStart": [
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "node ./session-brief.mjs",
        "cwd": ".github/hooks",
        "timeoutSec": 15
      }
    ],

    "subagentStart": [
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "node ./subagent-brief.mjs",
        "cwd": ".github/hooks",
        "timeoutSec": 15
      }
    ],

    "preToolUse": [
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "node ./guard-protected-paths.mjs",
        "cwd": ".github/hooks",
        "matcher": "create|edit|str_replace_editor|apply_patch|insert|delete|move",
        "timeoutSec": 15
      },
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "node ./guard-main-branch.mjs",
        "cwd": ".github/hooks",
        "matcher": "bash|powershell|write_bash",
        "timeoutSec": 15
      }
    ],

    "postToolUse": [
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "node ./verify-after-edit.mjs",
        "cwd": ".github/hooks",
        "matcher": "create|edit|str_replace_editor|apply_patch|insert",
        "timeoutSec": 320
      }
    ],

    "subagentStop": [
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "node ./guard-subagent-done.mjs",
        "cwd": ".github/hooks",
        "timeoutSec": 320
      }
    ]
  }
}
